Test Case Management Guide – Azure DevOps Test Plans
How we write, review, execute, and report on test cases in ADO Test Plans.
1. Purpose and Scope
This document defines the standard process for authoring and executing manual and automated test cases in Azure DevOps (ADO) Test Plans. It applies to all QA team members, developers, and product owners who contribute to or consume test results.
In scope: test plan structure, test case standards, review workflow, execution, defect logging, traceability, reporting.
Out of scope: automation framework design, performance and security test strategy (covered in separate documents).
